# Line endings are LF — in the index and in the working copy, on every platform.
#
# Prettier writes LF, and every text file here is already LF in the index. Git for
# Windows installs core.autocrlf=true system-wide, so without this file a Windows
# clone checks the same files out as CRLF and then reports files the change never
# touched as modified after `npm run verify` — a status entry with an empty diff.
# eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf, so the working copy matches what the gate writes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
